# Bundled artifacts, built per platform; never committed.
#
# The CONTENTS are ignored, not the directories. pyproject.toml force-includes
# both openrate/bin and openrate/lib into the wheel, and hatchling raises
# FileNotFoundError when a forced path is missing — so ignoring the directories
# themselves made `pip install -e sdks/python` fail on every clone, while
# `pip install openrate` 404s. The package was uninstallable by any documented
# route. The .gitkeep files are what make the paths exist in a checkout.
openrate/bin/*
!openrate/bin/.gitkeep
openrate/lib/*
!openrate/lib/.gitkeep
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
